<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>FileVault 2 - Recovery Password - Mac</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>Provides the FileVault 2 recovery password if FileVault was enabled using <STRONG>Fixlet: Invoke - FileVault 2 Encrypt System Volume - Mac</STRONG> </P>
<P>Information on using this content is available here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect/wiki/FileVault-2">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect/wiki/FileVault-2</A></P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Protect content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[mac of operating system and version of operating system > "10.7" as version]]></Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists files whose (name of it as lowercase starts with &quot;Recovery&quot; as lowercase and name of it as lowercase ends with &quot;.plist&quot; as lowercase) of folder &quot;FileVault&quot; of folder &quot;__Global&quot; of data folder of client</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="2" Name="FileVault 2 - Recovery Password - Mac">string &quot;RecoveryKey&quot; of dictionary of file &quot;Recovery.plist&quot; of folder &quot;FileVault&quot; of folder &quot;__Global&quot; of data folder of client</Property>
    <Property ID="3" Name="FileVault 2 - Recovery Password Useful - Mac">if (not exists (booleans of values of entries whose(&quot;CoreStorage Encrypted&quot; = key of it) of dictionaries whose( exists entries whose(&quot;BSD Name&quot; = key of it AND &quot;disk1&quot; = string of value of it) of it ) of nodes of nodes of nodes &quot;CoreStoragePhysical&quot; of nodes of nodes &quot;IOGUIDPartitionScheme&quot; of nodes of nodes &quot;IOBlockStorageDriver&quot; of nodes &quot;IOAHCIBlockStorageDevice&quot; of nodes &quot;AppleAHCIDiskDriver&quot; of nodes &quot;IOAHCIDevice&quot; of (it; nodes of nodes &quot;AppleAHCI&quot; of it) of nodes of nodes of nodes of nodes &quot;AppleACPIPCI&quot; of nodes whose(name of it starts with &quot;PCI&quot;) of nodes &quot;AppleACPIPlatformExpert&quot; of service plane of iokit registry)) then &quot;Drive is not Encrypted&quot; else &quot;Drive appears Encrypted&quot;</Property>
    <Property ID="4" Name="FileVault 2 - Previous Recovery Passwords - Mac">(string &quot;RecoveryKey&quot; of dictionary of it, modification time of it) of files whose (name of it as lowercase contains &quot;Recovery-&quot; as lowercase and name of it as lowercase ends with &quot;.plist&quot;) of folder &quot;FileVault&quot; of folder &quot;__Global&quot; of data folder of client</Property>
  </Analysis>
</BES>
